  }, {
    "tStartMs": 405290,
    "dDurationMs": 2920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you guys have a harder road\nto go through than I did."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 408210,
    "dDurationMs": 2310,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "For me it was really easy,\nthere was a lot of jobs,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 410520,
    "dDurationMs": 2410,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "economy was booming and all this."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 412930,
    "dDurationMs": 4280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And it was easier so you guys\nhave got to be smarter, okay?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 417210,
    "dDurationMs": 2323,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So as far as the subject of debt,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 419533,
    "dDurationMs": 3867,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "there's good debt and bad debt."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 423400,
    "dDurationMs": 2300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Again it goes back to\nthe financial statement,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 434510,
    "dDurationMs": 2543,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "income, expense,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 438880,
    "dDurationMs": 1690,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "asset, liability."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 440570,
    "dDurationMs": 2900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So debt falls in here."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 443470,
    "dDurationMs": 2630,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So I'll review, let's say I'm gonna buy"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 446100,
    "dDurationMs": 2170,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you know everybody says\nI'm gonna buy a house."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 448270,
    "dDurationMs": 2620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And everybody says my house is an asset."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 450890,
    "dDurationMs": 4590,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's not true, your\nhouse is a liability."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 455480,
    "dDurationMs": 3990,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I don't care if you put\nno debt on it or not,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 459470,
    "dDurationMs": 2100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "a house is a liability."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 461570,
    "dDurationMs": 2733,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Same as if you have a car."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 469563,
    "dDurationMs": 3107,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A car is a liability and\nthe reason for that is"
